OL,3,GNEWSATown has fewest jobs for young in
OL,4,AUK, report finds
OL,5,
OL,6,FRotherham has the fewest suitable
OL,7,Fentry-level jobs for young people in
OL,8,FBritain, according to a new report.
OL,10,FThe findings, published by the
OL,11,FInstitute for Public Policy Research
OL,12,F(IPPR), said the town had 46 online
OL,13,Fvacancies for every 1,000 young people,
OL,14,Fwhile the Cotswold district council
OL,15,Farea, for example, had 288.
OL,17,FSouth Yorkshire Mayor Oliver Coppard
OL,18,Fsaid it was a "shocking statistic".
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
